{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[],"persons":[{"id":"zhuge-p0018","name":"耿纯","evidence":["zhuge-q-o018","lizang-q-0be77f55ad289785d4fe"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"zhuge-m-o018-zhuge-p0018","kind":"allusion","text":"祖系或典故提及","evidence":["zhuge-q-o018"]},{"id":"lizang-m2-1f65f33c05c208590a4e","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["lizang-q-0be77f55ad289785d4fe"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"lizang-q-0be77f55ad289785d4fe","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-f2eeffe0f854d74bce8f","layer":"original","quote":"典宗族、部曲三千余家，居乘氏；自请，愿徙诣魏郡。太祖笑曰：“卿欲慕耿纯邪〖9〗？”典谢曰：“典驽怯功微，而爵宠过厚，诚宜举宗陈力〖10〗；加以征伐未息，宜实郊遂之内〖11〗，以制四方：非慕纯也","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":4,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":96,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhuge-q-o018","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-9c6ac9490dfbf75fe10c","layer":"original","quote":"二十六年〖2〗，群下劝先主称尊号〖3〗，先主未许。亮说曰：“昔吴汉、耿弇等初劝世祖即帝位〖4〗，世祖辞让，前后数四，耿纯进言曰〖5〗：‘天下英雄喁喁〖6〗，冀有所望〖7〗。如不从议者，士大夫各归求主〖8〗，无为从公也〖9〗！’世祖感纯言深至〖10〗，遂然诺之〖11〗。今曹氏篡汉，天下无主；大王刘氏苗族〖12〗，绍世而起〖13〗：今即帝位，乃其宜也！士大夫随大王久勤苦者，亦欲望尺寸之功如纯言耳〖14〗。”","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":101,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":203,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
